{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-btitle",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1900,
   "y": -760,
   "width": 1500,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "# Kimi K3 — one decoder layer  \nA MoE layer (all but L0). Grey bars = tensors (0.05 px/channel, long ones clipped), boxes = operations with their weights per layer. The token mixer is **either** the KDA column (left, 69 layers) **or** the gated-MLA columns (right, 24 layers)."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bnote",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -300,
   "y": -760,
   "width": 1500,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "**Layer variants.** KDA layer mixer 443.7M, MLA layer mixer 232.2M. L0 uses a dense SiTU-GLU FFN 7168→33792→7168 (726.7M) instead of the MoE. AttnRes, norms and MoE are identical everywhere (29K of AttnRes vectors per layer)."
  },
  {
   "id": "bs36",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -179,
   "y": -520,
   "width": 358,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl37",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 199,
   "y": -532,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`s [T, 7168]  partial sum of this block`"
  },
  {
   "id": "mix138",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": -471,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**AttnRes mix** (self_attention_res) — softmax over snapshots b + s, weighted sum  \n14K",
   "color": "#e879f9"
  },
  {
   "id": "bsnap",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -820,
   "y": -420,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**block snapshots** b0…b(k−1)  \n[T, k, 7168], k ≤ 8",
   "color": "#e879f9"
  },
  {
   "id": "bx39",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -179,
   "y": -351,
