  {
   "id": "note-push",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 560,
   "y": -560,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 110,
   "text": "At L0, L12, L24 … L84 the mix runs, then s is frozen as the next snapshot and reset to 0, so this layer's outputs start a new block sum."
  },
  {
   "id": "dqkv44",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1400,
   "y": -97,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**q_proj, k_proj, v_proj** 7168 → 12288 each  \n264.2M",
   "color": "#22d3ee"
  },
  {
   "id": "dt145",
