   "type": "text",
   "x": -1400,
   "y": 313,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**KDA delta rule** (per head)  \nS ← Diag(α)·S ;  S ← S + β·k(vᵀ − kᵀS) ;  o = Sᵀq",
   "color": "#22d3ee"
  },
  {
