   "id": "note-kv",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2250,
   "y": -117,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "Why MLA: the cache keeps one 512+64 latent per token instead of 96 heads × (192+128) keys and values (30,720 numbers); kv_b_proj re-expands it. Kimi K3 adds a sigmoid output gate and drops RoPE."
  },
